      "note": "Read 2026-11-17 through a summarizing fetch. Greedy quantifiers match 'the largest string possible'; the non-greedy versions (*?, +?) stop at the first match: re.findall('<.*>', '<a> b <c>') gives one span, '<.*?>' gives two. A course page, not the Python reference; the re module's own page was not opened."
